{"2315970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SHARKS", "steam_appid": 2315970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏴‍☠️🦜SEASON 1 - PIRATES 'Premium Pass' included with this version! 🦜🏴‍☠️</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into SHARKS, the multiplayer VR game where you and your friends become sharks exploring a living, physics-driven ocean together. Swim, hunt, and team up - with controls so easy, anyone can grab a controller (or mouse!) and start chomping. You can play flat-screen, VR or even cross-platform with your friends on the Meta Quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌊 A Living, Reactive Ocean</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a full-on physics sandbox where everything reacts to everything else. Bite and throw an explosive near a mine, cannonball or other shark and watch the chaos unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/786a336a60ee79b08004f23530670c9e.poster.avif?t=1784278107\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/786a336a60ee79b08004f23530670c9e.webm?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/786a336a60ee79b08004f23530670c9e.mp4?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👥 Multiplayer with Voice Chat</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join public rooms to meet new players, or create private ones for friends. Team up to take down challenges - like popping the piñata or battling the Skull Rock skeleton boss - for huge rewards for the whole crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/02050099d5657f94b071431217fbc8cf.poster.avif?t=1784278107\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/02050099d5657f94b071431217fbc8cf.webm?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/02050099d5657f94b071431217fbc8cf.mp4?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 Comfort-First Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No flapping arms, no complicated setup. Just look where you want to go, trigger to swim, grab to bite. You can also play on your flat-screen with a mouse: left click to move, right click to bite. Smooth camera, responsive head-tracking, zero setup - perfect whether you're a VR first-timer or seasoned pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/34fdc90bb1b8df7c7672ebd0fbd40d9c.poster.avif?t=1784278107\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/34fdc90bb1b8df7c7672ebd0fbd40d9c.webm?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/34fdc90bb1b8df7c7672ebd0fbd40d9c.mp4?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏴‍☠️ Season 1: Pirates — Live Now</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests together, earn XP, and level up through the tiers for exclusive season only rewards. Plus this version includes the 'Premium Pass' to unlock even more unique rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/e846052a556e2ec4bf4d6eda6cf48704.poster.avif?t=1784278107\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/e846052a556e2ec4bf4d6eda6cf48704.webm?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/e846052a556e2ec4bf4d6eda6cf48704.mp4?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💰 Collect, Salvage, Customize</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry loot in your mouth to the salvage cage, hoist it up for Goldfish, then trick out your shark to reflect your personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/0ccb978ae4f916627c801aa970f90417.poster.avif?t=1784278107\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/0ccb978ae4f916627c801aa970f90417.webm?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/0ccb978ae4f916627c801aa970f90417.mp4?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>🚗 Play Anywhere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfy, low-motion controls make SHARKS a great pick for VR on the go — play as a passenger in a car, boat, or plane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/689478133dcf85df669e82000204075a.poster.avif?t=1784278107\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/689478133dcf85df669e82000204075a.webm?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/689478133dcf85df669e82000204075a.mp4?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ready to explore the ocean's depths with friends? Grab your mouse or headset and dive in!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏴‍☠️🦜SEASON 1 - PIRATES 'Premium Pass' included with this version! 🦜🏴‍☠️</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into SHARKS, the multiplayer VR game where you and your friends become sharks exploring a living, physics-driven ocean together. Swim, hunt, and team up - with controls so easy, anyone can grab a controller (or mouse!) and start chomping. You can play flat-screen, VR or even cross-platform with your friends on the Meta Quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌊 A Living, Reactive Ocean</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a full-on physics sandbox where everything reacts to everything else. Bite and throw an explosive near a mine, cannonball or other shark and watch the chaos unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/786a336a60ee79b08004f23530670c9e.poster.avif?t=1784278107\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/786a336a60ee79b08004f23530670c9e.webm?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/786a336a60ee79b08004f23530670c9e.mp4?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👥 Multiplayer with Voice Chat</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join public rooms to meet new players, or create private ones for friends. Team up to take down challenges - like popping the piñata or battling the Skull Rock skeleton boss - for huge rewards for the whole crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/02050099d5657f94b071431217fbc8cf.poster.avif?t=1784278107\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/02050099d5657f94b071431217fbc8cf.webm?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/02050099d5657f94b071431217fbc8cf.mp4?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 Comfort-First Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No flapping arms, no complicated setup. Just look where you want to go, trigger to swim, grab to bite. You can also play on your flat-screen with a mouse: left click to move, right click to bite. Smooth camera, responsive head-tracking, zero setup - perfect whether you're a VR first-timer or seasoned pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/34fdc90bb1b8df7c7672ebd0fbd40d9c.poster.avif?t=1784278107\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/34fdc90bb1b8df7c7672ebd0fbd40d9c.webm?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/34fdc90bb1b8df7c7672ebd0fbd40d9c.mp4?t=1784278107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏴‍☠️ Season 1: Pirates — Live Now</strong></p